CSS allows for HTML object coloring, it uses various color notations including: RGB, RGBA, Hex, HSL, HSLA and Color Name

h1{
  color: color_name;
}

E.G.:

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>CSS Color_name Color</title>
  
    <style>
        h1 {
            color: green;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>GeeksforGeeks</h1>
</body>

</html>
